= Typst

- #link("/docs/guide/tools/site-data/")[Site data and queries] groups pages, lists headings, and queries reachable pages.
- #link("/docs/guide/tools/page-presentation/")[Images, icons, and code] renders responsive images, SVG icons, and highlighted code.
- #link("/docs/guide/tools/publication/")[Sharing, feeds, and sitemaps] adds social previews, RSS, and a sitemap.

= Nushell

- #link("/docs/guide/tools/nushell/")[Nushell scripts] writes JSON from a hook and uses the bundled image and diagnostic commands.

See #link("/docs/reference/packages/")[Built-in packages] and #link("/docs/reference/scripts/")[Built-in scripts] for signatures and options.
